        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 8,
        "ActionId": 8,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Luna could always tell what Lucia was thinking from her expression, but ever since her cathartic cry that night in the rain, Lucia has seemingly vented all her emotions."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
